[
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 8,
    "text": "> Calibrator 如何把 AI 生成或人工绘制的赛道底图，校准为可被运行时稳定使用的 `track.profile.json`。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 10,
    "text": "本次 Race 评审的是学生作为 **智能体工程师 / Agentic Engineer** 的综合能力，包括实时可视化理解、交互与信息架构、前端工程实现、几何与动画建模、资产生产工具设计、演示表达，以及与 Agent 协同完成真实创造的 **Agent Riding Skill**。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 14,
    "text": "> 一块赛事大屏可以由可信数据、可信赛道几何和可维护资产流程驱动，而不是靠手写位置、静态贴图或一次性动画伪装出来。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 30,
    "text": "- Race Live 主赛道；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 33,
    "text": "- Riding Message 气泡或底部 ticker；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 38,
    "text": "### 2. 必须有 Calibrator 或可验证的赛道校准流程"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 40,
    "text": "作品必须说明并演示赛道底图如何变成可运行的语义赛道资产。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 44,
    "text": "- 导入或使用一张赛道底图；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 45,
    "text": "- 定义或编辑 centerline points；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 49,
    "text": "- 导出或展示 `track.profile.json`；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 52,
    "text": "Calibrator 可以是完整工具、简化工具、开发者工具页，或具备清楚操作流程的 PoC，但不能完全没有赛道校准过程。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 58,
    "text": "- 赛道底图只负责视觉；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 59,
    "text": "- 赛道几何由 `track.profile.json` 或等价结构描述；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 62,
    "text": "- 不能把马匹、排名编号、气泡和风险标记直接画死在底图中。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 73,
    "text": "2. 多个 Racing Entry 在赛道上随进度变化；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 75,
    "text": "4. Calibrator 导入或使用赛道底图；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 77,
    "text": "6. 导出的 `track.profile.json` 如何被 Jumbotron 使用；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 107,
    "text": "   - 数据与资产说明；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 119,
    "text": "4. **赛道资产**"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 120,
    "text": "   - `background.webp` 或等价底图；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 121,
    "text": "   - `track.profile.json`；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 124,
    "text": "   - `source.prompt.md`，若使用 AI 生成底图。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 166,
    "text": "- Header、KPI Strip、主赛道、TOP3、底部 ticker 等区域是否清楚；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 169,
    "text": "- 是否能展示 Riding Message 气泡或现场播报；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 182,
    "text": "## 3. Calibrator 与赛道资产生产｜20 分"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 184,
    "text": "评审重点：团队是否证明了赛道资产可以被生产、校准、验证和复用。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 189,
    "text": "- 是否能导入或使用赛道底图；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 190,
    "text": "- 是否能创建、编辑或导入 centerline points；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 197,
    "text": "- 是否能 Export `track.profile.json`；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 198,
    "text": "- 是否能解释 `track.profile.json` 中的关键字段；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 199,
    "text": "- 是否能说明 AI 生成底图与人工校准之间的关系；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 200,
    "text": "- 是否能提交至少一套可用赛道资产。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 204,
    "text": "> Calibrator 不是摆设，而是真正让一张视觉底图变成可运行赛道资产；评委能看到从底图、路径校准、预览、验证到导出 profile 的完整流程。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 217,
    "text": "- 是否能将 progress 映射到 centerline path 上的采样点；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 223,
    "text": "- 是否支持 debug mode 或等价调试视图，展示 centerline、sampled points、lane offsets、checkpoints、horse s value；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 229,
    "text": "> 评委可以相信这套系统不是一次性动效，而是由 track profile、snapshot data 和 runtime logic 驱动；换一套数据或换一条赛道，仍然有机会继续工作。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 251,
    "text": "> 看完短视频，不需要额外解释，就能理解这套 Jumbotron 怎么跑、Calibrator 怎么用、赛道资产怎么进入运行时。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 294,
    "text": "> 评委或后续团队不需要猜，就能快速理解：你做了什么，怎么运行，数据怎么进来，赛道怎么校准，哪些地方还需要继续完善。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 317,
    "text": "### 3. 多赛道资产能力"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 319,
    "text": "不仅完成一条赛道，还能展示至少两条不同赛道资产，并证明 Jumbotron 可以切换 profile 运行。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 323,
    "text": "提供 centerline、sampled points、lane offsets、checkpoints、collision boxes、stale entries 等调试展示，让评委能看懂底层几何和运行时状态。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 331,
    "text": "能说明 Riding Message、风险、违章、ticker、气泡如何排序、筛选、限流和 fallback，避免现场大屏被消息淹没。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 348,
    "text": "2. 没有 Calibrator，也无法说明赛道资产如何被校准为可运行 profile；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 351,
    "text": "5. 赛马位置、排名、气泡和风险标记全部写死在图片或设计稿中；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 352,
    "text": "6. 无法解释 `track.profile.json` 或等价赛道语义资产的作用；"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 356,
    "text": "10. 无法说明本次 PoC 与“可信赛事大屏 / 可校准赛道资产”之间的关系。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 369,
    "text": "核心命题理解准确，Jumbotron 和 Calibrator 都有可演示成果，赛道几何与数据映射基本正确。过程记录较完整，短视频能讲清主要链路，但工程完整度、异常处理、debug mode 或资产流程仍有提升空间。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 373,
    "text": "基本完成 Jumbotron 原型，有一定 Calibrator 或赛道配置流程，但系统边界、track-runtime 复用、数据契约、动画正确性或短视频表达存在明显不足。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 377,
    "text": "完成了基本提交，但更多停留在 UI Demo 或概念展示。Jumbotron 可看但不够可信，Calibrator 证明力不足，赛道位置和数据驱动关系不清楚，过程记录较弱。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 392,
    "text": "   最佳赛道校准工具奖：奖励 Calibrator 使用流程最完整、赛道资产生产最清楚的团队。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 396,
    "text": "   最佳动态表现奖：奖励赛马位置、方向、补间、状态机、消息气泡表现最自然的团队。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "评审标准",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/ARY GRS 002 Jumbotron 评审标准.md",
    "line": 416,
    "text": "> **他们能够通过 Calibrator 把赛道视觉资产校准为可运行的语义赛道，并通过短视频清楚说明 Jumbotron 与 Calibrator 的使用方式？**"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 4,
    "text": "> Jumbotron 是 Workshop / Hackathon / 团队协作场景下的公开大屏容器，负责展示赛事化摘要、实时态势、赛道位置、风险和协作入口；它不展示完整 Coding Agent Session 细节。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 65,
    "text": "它面向现场观众和组织者，强调赛道、位置、追赶关系、实时消息和现场氛围。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 191,
    "text": "赛道模板由视觉底图和语义赛道共同构成。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 199,
    "text": "├── centerlinePath"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 204,
    "text": "└── safeZones"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 207,
    "text": "`backgroundAsset` 是视觉皮肤，`centerlinePath` 才是用于定位的赛道中心线。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 211,
    "text": "Race Live View 中的赛马位置不是固定 `x / y` 坐标，而是由进度和赛道几何派生。"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 220,
    "text": "roundProgress → centerlinePath distance → point → rotation → laneOffset → displayAdjustment"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 233,
    "text": "| blocked | 被阻碍或存在高风险 | 停顿 / 警示标记 |"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
    "line": 236,
    "text": "| finished | 当前 Round 或阶段完成 | 冲线 / 完成标记 |"
  },
  {
    "doc": "信息架构",
    "path": "/media/lemonhdl/Shared/Software_Engineering/ary-grs-002-sinbawang/Jumbotron信息架构.md",
